  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "beta.3:\n- Generated state properties now match the accessibility of the member they wrap, so members typed with private nested types no longer hit CS0053. [Reactive] fields may now be any non-public accessibility.\n- Generated files carry the source .razor file's @using directives plus all _Imports.razor usings, so field/return types that rely on a using (e.g. MudBlazor's DateRange) no longer hit CS0246.\n- New StatefulLayoutComponent base for layouts (LayoutComponentBase flavor of StatefulComponent); state classes now take the ITempestComponent interface.\n\nbeta.2 (breaking): flat generated members (IsLoading{Name}, {Name}Error, {Name}Command, Try{Name}Command) are replaced by one {Name}State property per member.\n- [Command] generates CommandState (Task/ValueTask/void) or CommandState<T> with Result/HasResult (Task<T>/ValueTask<T>/T).\n- [Event, Command] generates EventCommandState<TEvent>.\n- Latest-wins cancellation via an optional trailing CancellationToken parameter.\n- New [Reactive] fields generate a ReactiveState<T> twin (Value/SetSilently/Initial/IsDirty/Reset) with an optional partial On{Name}Changed(T value) hook.",
